# - Karukerament, #streamcaribbean review of Ki Sos Ou Vle? (July 2024 album, review opened 2026-10-20): career spanning more than 20 years, modern-day storyteller from Guadeloupe, rapper, singer, actor and voice-over, author, second full album with 22 tracks, rap to bouyon to reggae, dancehall, zouk, Caribbean pop and gospel, bouyon and soca tracks Bravoléfi - Bendova, Bénévolat and Fais La Belle, plus Lari Réyèl, Respectable, Reverse, Enjoy, Pa Vin Fan Chyé Jod La, Chodo Gato, Ganyé, Devant, A La Maison, Only You, Bonne Nuit, KDO, Katchoupine, Semblant, Body Contact, Obsession and Emoji Flamme, and Holy Wata as a collaboration with TK International (Triple K Band) on another version of Whistle While You Work. Reviewer calls him, as an opinion, the most versatile artist of his generation and the album the best Guadeloupean album of 2024.
